  Search results template.

  Replaces templates/search.json, which rendered Dawn's main-search section.
  A .liquid template with a static {% section %} tag rather than a JSON one,
  for the same reason as the homepage and the collection page: a JSON template
  lets the customizer reorder and delete sections, and this page's structure is
  fixed by the design. See PLAN.md, Decision #12.
{%- endcomment -%}

